sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant PaySvc as Payment Service
    participant Gateway as External Payment Gateway
    participant Kafka as Message Broker
    participant OrdSvc as Order Service

    User->>API: POST /api/payments (RES-123)
    API->>PaySvc: Initiate Payment
    PaySvc->>Gateway: Charge Card
    
    alt Success
        Gateway-->>PaySvc: Success (TX-999)
        PaySvc->>PaySvc: Update Payment Status = SUCCESS
        PaySvc->>Kafka: Publish PaymentSucceeded(TX-999)
        PaySvc-->>API: 200 OK
        API-->>User: Payment Successful
        
        Note over Kafka,OrdSvc: Asynchronous Order Creation
        Kafka-->>OrdSvc: Consume PaymentSucceeded
        OrdSvc->>OrdSvc: Idempotency Check
        OrdSvc->>OrdSvc: Create Order (Status=CONFIRMED)
        
    else Timeout / Failure
        Gateway-->>PaySvc: Timeout / Error
        PaySvc->>PaySvc: Update Payment Status = FAILED
        PaySvc->>Kafka: Publish PaymentFailed(RES-123)
        PaySvc-->>API: 402 Payment Required
        API-->>User: Payment Failed
    end
